		"description": {
			"public": "<p><strong>Dverung Weapon Rune</strong> &middot; <strong>Price:</strong> found, not sold</p><p><em>A small rune inscribed on a rare mineral from Kral Vetu.</em></p><hr><p>Adds 1d6 damage. On miss: you take this damage instead.</p><p><em>Dverung Runes meld into equipment, consuming the rune. Capacity: Common &amp; Uncommon 1 rune &middot; Rare &amp; Very Rare 2 runes &middot; Legendary 3 runes. Activate the rune to meld it &mdash; the module applies the effect to the chosen item and enforces capacity.</em></p><p class=\"nim-plus-credit\"><em>&mdash; Squeekie (design) & Uruzrune (theme), Nim+ Volume IV</em></p>",
